# Loaded ONLY by `npm run dev` (Vite dev mode) — never by the prod build.
#
# Cloudflare Turnstile: use the official always-PASS dummy sitekey locally so
# the widget renders + solves on ANY host (incl. localhost) without calling
# Cloudflare or consuming the real widget's quota. Pairs with the email
# backend's dummy TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY (face-backend/.env). The PROD build
# uses the real public key from config.ts's default (or VITE_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY).
VITE_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=1x00000000000000000000AA
